      // Today the answer lives in two places, and only one of them is home-scoped:
      //   `state/specStore`    home_specs_<homeId>, per-checkpoint label/value, 38 importers, and what
      //                        the PDF reads.
      //   `core/db/specsStore` technical_specs_<inspectionId>, the inspector's whole spec INVENTORY,
      //                        16 importers, AsyncStorage, and no homeScope import at all.
      // This is where an inspector's Rheem water heater, with its serial and its manual, finally
