      // ── home_observations ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
      // WHAT THE HOUSE KNOWS IS WRONG WITH IT (Ruling 1; Phase 2 step B7a, ruling D-2).
      //
      // ── THE CONSTRAINT THIS REMOVES, AND HOW ────────────────────────────────────────
